    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 601332e6f23b37196f877b4c3cda7f96d6d7c768 -->\n\nVerdict: Ready for the maintainer to merge.\n\nReview of head `601332e6f23b37196f877b4c3cda7f96d6d7c768`.\n\n**Trial merge.** The head merges cleanly with `main` (57f2ffbbf). No conflict. The run used a local review worktree.\n\n**Build.** `cargo build -p camcraft-ui` succeeded. E0004 is gone. `short_caption` now has an arm for `MachineKind::Waterjet`. The match covers all seven kinds, with no wildcard arm.\n\n**Tests.** `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib machine_mode`: 9 passed, 0 failed. The new test `every_machine_kind_has_a_short_caption` pins the Waterjet caption. It asserts a short caption and a full caption for each kind.\n\n**Clippy.** `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n**Law checks.**\n- The caption word \"Waterjet\" matches the style of the other arms and the tool pane's name.\n- Neutral naming holds in the new strings.\n- No `unwrap`, `expect` or `panic` in the diff.\n- The PR touches no process file, `Cargo.toml`, `build.rs`, `.github` file, or snapshot PNG.\n- `docs/decisions/2143-waterjet-caption.md` matches the format in `docs/decisions/README.md`.\n- The body is complete: a `Changelog:` line, and `Fixes #2143`.\n\n**Not exercised.** The full ui suite, the app suites, and the snapshot lane. The author states the same in the body.\n\n**Note, not blocking.** `caption()` gives Waterjet the \"Machine\" fallback. The decision file records why no ribbon mode row is due yet. A future built-in waterjet machine needs its row.\n",
